riendly version of the name. It is usually all lowercase and contains only letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'“slug” 是名称的 URL 友好版本。它通常全部为小写，仅包含字母、数字和下划线。','DO NOT EDIT the taxonomy slug unless also planning to migrate terms. Changing the slug registers a new taxonomy entry.'=>'除非也计划迁移术语，否则请勿编辑 taxonomy slug。更改 slug 会注册新的 taxonomy 条目。','Migrate terms to newly renamed taxonomy?'=>'将术语迁移到新命名的 taxonomy 吗？','(e.g. Jobs)'=>'(例如：Jobs)','Plural Label'=>'复数标签','(e.g. Job)'=>'(例如：Job)','Singular Label'=>'单数标签','Parent-Child Relationships'=>'父子关系','Can terms in this taxonomy be organized into hierarchical relationships?'=>'此分类法中的术语可以组织成层次关系吗？','Description'=>'描述','Describe what your taxonomy is used for.'=>'描述您的分类法的用途。','Default Terms'=>'默认术语','Set the default terms for this taxonomy. These will be automatically added to all new posts. Enter the term names or slugs. Separate multiple terms with by comma.'=>'为此分类法设置默认术语。这些术语将自动添加到所有新帖子中。输入术语名称或别名。用逗号分隔多个术语。','Archive page result'=>'存档页面结果','Normally, WordPress will only show one post type on taxonomy archive pages. Enable this feature to show content from all selected posts types.'=>'通常，WordPress 只会在分类法存档页面上显示一种帖子类型。启用此功能以显示所有选定的帖子类型的内容。','Rewrite'=>'重写','WordPress can use a custom permalink for this taxonomy. It does not have to match the slug.'=>'WordPress 可以为此分类法使用自定义永久链接。它不必与别名匹配。','(default: taxonomy name)'=>'(默认：分类法名称)','Custom Rewrite Slug'=>'自定义重写别名','Custom taxonomy rewrite slug.'=>'自定义分类法重写别名。','Rewrite With Front'=>'带前缀的重写','Should the permastruct be prepended with the front base.'=>'永久结构是否应以前缀基础开头。','Rewrite Hierarchical'=>'重写层次结构','Should the permastruct allow hierarchical urls.'=>'永久结构是否允许层次 URL。','Show user interface'=>'显示用户界面','Should there be a visible interface in the WordPress admin area to manage these terms?'=>'在 WordPress 管理区域中是否应该有一个可见的界面来管理这些术语？','Show in admin menus'=>'在管理菜单中显示','Should there be links to this taxonomy in the WordPress admin menus?'=>'在WordPress管理菜单中是否应该有指向此taxonomy的链接？','Show in frontend menus'=>'在前端菜单中显示','Should this taxonomy be available for the frontend “Menus” and “Navigation” options?'=>'此taxonomy是否应该在前端的“菜单”和“导航”选项中可用？','Show admin column'=>'显示管理列','Should a column for this taxonomy appear on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'此taxonomy的列是否应该出现在“文章”和“页面”等屏幕上？','Show in "Quick Edit" and "Bulk Edit"'=>'在“快速编辑”和“批量编辑”中显示','Should this taxonomy be available in editing tools on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'此taxonomy是否应该在“文章”和“页面”等屏幕的编辑工具中可用？','Show in Filter'=>'在筛选器中显示','Should this taxonomy be available in filters on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'此taxonomy是否应该在“文章”和“页面”等屏幕的筛选器中可用？','Menu Name'=>'菜单名称','Custom admin menu name for your taxonomy.'=>'您taxonomy的自定义管理菜单名称。','(e.g. All Jobs)'=>'(例如：所有作业)','All Items'=>'所有项目','Used as tab text when showing all terms for hierarchical taxonomy while editing post.'=>'在编辑文章时用于显示层次taxonomy的所有条目的标签文本。','(e.g. Edit Job)'=>'(例如：编辑作业)','Edit Item'=>'编辑项目','Used at the top of the term editor screen for an existing taxonomy term.'=>'用于现有taxonomy条目的术语编辑器屏幕顶部。','(e.g. View Job)'=>'(例如：查看作业)','View Item'=>'查看项目','Used in the admin bar when viewing editor screen for an existing taxonomy term.'=>'在查看现有 taxonomy 术语的编辑器屏幕时使用的管理栏。','(e.g. Update Job Name)'=>'(例如：更新工作名称)','Update Item Name'=>'更新项目名称','Custom taxonomy label. Used in the admin menu for displaying taxonomies.'=>'自定义 taxonomy 标签。在管理菜单中用于显示 taxonomies。','Update %s name'=>'更新 %s 名称','(e.g. Add New Job)'=>'(例如：添加新工作)','Add New Item'=>'添加新项目','Used at the top of the term editor screen and button text for a new taxonomy term.'=>'用于术语编辑器屏幕顶部和新 taxonomy 术语的按钮文本。','(e.g. New Job Name)'=>'(例如：新工作名称)','New Item Name'=>'新项目名称','(e.g. Parent Job)'=>'(例如：父工作)','Parent Item'=>'父项目','(e.g. Parent Job:)'=>'(例如：父工作：)','Parent Item Colon'=>'父项目冒号','(e.g. Search Jobs)'=>'(例如：搜索工作)','Search Items'=>'搜索项目','(e.g. Popular Jobs)'=>'(例如：热门工作)','Popular Items'=>'热门项目','(e.g. Separate Jobs with commas)'=>'(例如：用逗号分隔工作)','Separate Items with Commas'=>'用逗号分隔项目','(e.g. Add or remove Jobs)'=>'(例如，添加或移除工作)','Add or Remove Items'=>'添加或移除项目','(e.g. Choose from the most used Jobs)'=>'(例如，从最常用的工作中选择)','Choose From Most Used'=>'从最常用的中选择','(e.g. No jobs)'=>'(例如，没有工作)','No terms'=>'没有术语','Used when indicating that there are no terms in the given taxonomy associated with an object.'=>'用于指示在给定的分类法中与对象关联的术语不存在。','No %s'=>'没有 %s','(e.g. Jobs list navigation)'=>'(例如，工作列表导航)','Items List Navigation'=>'项目列表导航','Screen reader text for the pagination heading on the term listing screen.'=>'在术语列表屏幕上的分页标题的屏幕阅读器文本。','%s list navigation'=>'%s 列表导航','(e.g. Jobs list)'=>'(例如，工作列表)','Items List'=>'项目列表','Screen reader text for the items list heading on the term listing screen.'=>'在术语列表屏幕上的项目列表标题的屏幕阅读器文本。','%s list'=>'%s 列表','(e.g. No jobs found)'=>'(例如，未找到工作)','Not Found'=>'未找到','The text displayed via clicking ‘Choose from the most used items’ in the taxonomy meta box when no items are available.'=>'在分类法元框中点击“从最常用的项目中选择”时显示的文本，当没有可用项目时。','No %s found'=>'没有找到 %s','(e.g. &larr; Back to jobs'=>'(例如 &larr; 返回到职位','Back to Items'=>'返回到项目','The text displayed after a term has been updated for a link back to main index.'=>'更新后显示的文本，用于链接回主索引。','Back to %s'=>'返回到 %s','Show in REST API'=>'在 REST API 中显示','Add the taxonomy to the WordPress wp-json API.'=>'将分类法添加到 WordPress wp-json API。','REST API base slug'=>'REST API 基础 slug','The base slug that this taxonomy will use in the REST API.'=>'此分类法在 REST API 中使用的基础 slug。','REST API controller class'=>'REST API 控制器类','The name of a custom Rest Controller class instead of WP_REST_Terms_Controller.'=>'自定义 Rest 控制器类的名称，而不是 WP_REST_Terms_Controller。','Custom controller to use instead of WP_REST_Terms_Controller.'=>'自定义控制器，用于替代 WP_REST_Terms_Controller。','Public'=>'公开','The taxonomy is for public use. It can be seen by frontend users.'=>'该分类法供公共使用。前端用户可以看到。','Public Queryable'=>'公开可查询','The taxonomy is publicly queryable.'=>'该分类法可以公开查询。','Query Var'=>'查询变量','Enable a custom query_var key for this taxonomy.'=>'为此分类法启用自定义 query_var 键。','Custom Query Var String'=>'自定义查询变量字符串','Sets a custom query_var slug for this taxonomy.'=>'为此分类法设置自定义 query_var slug。','Metabox callback'=>'Metabox 回调','Sets a callback function name for the meta box display. Hierarchical default: post_categories_meta_box, non-hierarchical default: post_tags_meta_box. To remove the metabox completely, use "false".'=>'设置一个回调函数名称用于元框显示。层次结构默认值：post_categories_meta_box，非层次结构默认值：post_tags_meta_box。要完全移除元框，请使用 "false"。','Categories'=>'Categories','This feature controls the order of %s when you\'re editing posts, and in frontend displays.'=>'此功能控制您在编辑帖子时 %s 的顺序，以及在前端显示时的顺序。','Enable PublishPress Taxonomies ordering'=>'启用 PublishPress taxonomy 排序','Enable PublishPress Taxonomies ordering for this taxonomy in the frontend and admin area.'=>'在前端和管理区域启用此 taxonomy 的 PublishPress taxonomy 排序。','Re-activate Taxonomy'=>'重新激活 taxonomy','Deactivate Taxonomy'=>'停用 taxonomy','Delete Taxonomy'=>'删除 taxonomy','Delete PublishPress Taxonomies Edit Data'=>'删除 PublishPress taxonomy 编辑数据','You can only delete taxonomies created with PublishPress Taxonomies. However, you can delete any changes or edit made from PublishPress Taxonomies which will remove PublishPress Taxonomies version edit restoring original taxonomies data or removing it if already deleted'=>'您只能删除使用 PublishPress taxonomy 创建的 taxonomy。不过，您可以删除从 PublishPress taxonomy 所做的任何更改或编辑，这将删除 PublishPress taxonomy 版本编辑，恢复原始 taxonomy 数据或移除已删除的内容。','Save Taxonomy'=>'保存 taxonomy','Add Taxonomy'=>'添加 taxonomy','Term copied successfully.'=>'术语复制成功。','Term deleted successfully.'=>'术语删除成功。','Term removed from all posts successfully.'=>'术语成功从所有帖子中移除。','Count'=>'计数','Custom URL'=>'自定义 URL','Synonyms'=>'同义词','Linked Terms'=>'关联术语','Status'=>'状态','Copy'=>'复制','Select Destination Taxonomy'=>'选择目标 taxonomy','Search posts'=>'搜索帖子','post type'=>'post type','Select Destination %s'=>'选择目标 %s','Filter'=>'筛选','Terms deleted successfully.'=>'条目已成功删除。','Term(s) copied successfully.'=>'条目已成功复制。','Hidden'=>'隐藏','Live'=>'公开','No terms found.'=>'未找到条目。','Quick edit &#8220;%s&#8221; inline'=>'快速编辑 &#8220;%s&#8221; 内联','Quick&nbsp;Edit'=>'快速&nbsp;编辑','Remove From All Posts'=>'从所有帖子中移除','View'=>'查看','Quick Edit'=>'快速编辑','Cancel'=>'取消','Update'=>'更新','Terms'=>'条目','This screen allows you to search and edit all the terms on your site.'=>'此屏幕允许您搜索和编辑您网站上的所有条目。','This screen allows you to order terms via drag and drop.'=>'此屏幕允许您通过拖放来排序术语。','Search Terms'=>'搜索术语','Media Tags'=>'媒体标签','Media Tag'=>'媒体标签','All Media Tags'=>'所有媒体标签','Edit Media Tag'=>'编辑媒体标签','View Media Tag'=>'查看媒体标签','Update Media Tag name'=>'更新媒体标签名称','Add new Media Tag'=>'添加新的媒体标签','New Media Tag name'=>'新媒体标签名称','Parent Media Tag'=>'父媒体标签','Parent Media Tag:'=>'父媒体标签：','Search Media Tags'=>'搜索媒体标签','Popular Media Tags'=>'热门媒体标签','Separate Media Tags with commas'=>'用逗号分隔媒体标签','Add or remove Media Tags'=>'添加或删除媒体标签','Choose from the most used Media Tags'=>'从最常用的媒体标签中选择','No Media Tags found'=>'未找到媒体标签','No Media Tags'=>'没有媒体标签','Media Tags list navigation'=>'媒体标签列表导航','Media Tags list'=>'媒体标签列表','Back to Media Tags'=>'返回媒体标签','PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','Search PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'搜索 PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','Edit PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'编辑 PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','Update PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'更新 PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','Add New PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'添加新的 PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','New PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'新的 PublishPress Taxonomies 日志','You\'re using PublishPress Taxonomies Free. The Pro version has more features and support.'=>'您正在使用 PublishPress Taxonomies 免费版。专业版具有更多功能和支持。','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'升级到 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro','Enhance the power of PublishPress Taxonomies with the Pro version:'=>'通过专业版增强 PublishPress Taxonomies 的功能：','Unlimited “Term Display”'=>'无限制的“术语显示”','Unlimited “Terms for Current Posts”'=>'无限制的“当前帖子术语”','Unlimited “Related Posts”'=>'无限制的“相关帖子”','Unlimited “Auto Links”'=>'无限制的“自动链接”','Unlimited “Auto Terms”'=>'无限制的“自动术语”','Create new terms using OpenAI and other sources'=>'使用 OpenAI 和其他来源创建新术语','Use Linked Terms'=>'使用关联术语','Use Synonyms'=>'使用同义词','Schedule Auto Terms to run automatically'=>'安排自动术语自动运行','Control the display of term metaboxes'=>'控制术语元框的显示','Fast, professional support'=>'快速、专业的支持','No ads inside the plugin'=>'插件内部无广告','Need PublishPress Taxonomies Support?'=>'需要 PublishPress Taxonomies 支持吗？','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'如果您需要帮助或有新的功能请求，请告诉我们。','Request Support'=>'请求支持','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'详细文档也可以在插件网站上找到。','View Knowledge Base'=>'查看知识库','OpenAI Integration'=>'OpenAI 集成','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate OpenAI to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您集成 OpenAI 来分析您的内容并建议术语。','IBM Watson Integration'=>'IBM Watson 集成','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate Watson to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您集成 Watson 来分析您的内容并建议术语。','Dandelion Integration'=>'蒲公英集成','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate Dandelion to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您集成蒲公英来分析您的内容并建议术语。','LSEG / Refinitiv Integration'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv 集成','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate LSEG / Refinitiv to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您集成 LSEG / Refinitiv 来分析您的内容并建议术语。','Suggest terms using AI'=>'使用 AI 建议术语','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the OpenAI. This service can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您使用 OpenAI 为您的内容建议新术语。此服务可以分析您的内容并建议新术语。','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the IBM Watson. This service can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允许您使用 IBM Watson 为您的内容建议新术语。此服务可以分析您的内容并建议新术语。','Copy with Metadata'=>'复制带元数据','Auto terms using AI'=>'使用AI自动生成术语','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to generate new terms for your content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. These services can analyze your content and add new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您使用OpenAI、IBM Watson、Dandelion和Open Calais服务为您的内容生成新术语。这些服务可以分析您的内容并添加新术语。','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. These services can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您使用OpenAI、IBM Watson、Dandelion和Open Calais服务为您的内容建议新术语。这些服务可以分析您的内容并建议新术语。','Add Custom Elements'=>'添加自定义元素','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you complete control over where Auto Links are added. You can choose to skip any HTML elements that appear in your content.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您完全控制自动链接添加的位置。您可以选择跳过出现在您内容中的任何HTML元素。','Use Regular Expressions to modify Auto Terms'=>'使用正则表达式修改自动术语','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to change how Auto Terms analyzes your posts. You will need to know how to write Regular Expressions to use this feature.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您更改自动术语分析您帖子的方法。您需要知道如何编写正则表达式才能使用此功能。','This feature allows you to connect terms. When the main term or any of these terms are added to the post, all the other terms will be added also.'=>'此功能允许您连接术语。当主术语或这些术语中的任何一个被添加到帖子时，所有其他术语也将被添加。','Linked Terms Feature'=>'链接术语功能','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to create powerful connections between your terms. When one term is added to a post, its linked terms can be automatically added too. This helps maintain consistent organization across your content.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您在术语之间创建强大的连接。当一个术语被添加到帖子时，其链接术语也可以自动添加。这有助于在您的内容中保持一致的组织。','This feature allows you to associate additional words with each term. For example, "website" can have synonyms such as "websites", "web site", and "web pages".'=>'此功能允许您将额外的词与每个术语关联。例如，“网站”可以具有“网站”、“网页”和“网页”的同义词。','Synonyms Terms Feature'=>'同义词术语功能','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to have multiple words associated with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro允许您有多个词与单个术语关联。如果PublishPress Taxonomies扫描您的内容并找到一个同义词，它将表现得像找到了主术语。','Taxonomy Display'=>'分类显示','This feature is available in PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'此功能在PublishPress Taxonomies Pro中可用','Customize the display of terms in the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'自定义PublishPress Taxonomies元框中术语的显示。','Options include checkboxes and a dropdown list.'=>'选项包括复选框和下拉列表。','Copy Term with Metadata'=>'复制带有元数据的术语','To Copy terms with their metadata, please upgrade to pro.'=>'要复制带有元数据的术语，请升级到专业版。','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can duplicate taxonomy terms along with all their metadata. This includes term descriptions, images, and custom fields. You can copy terms between taxonomies to maintain consistent organization across your site.'=>'使用PublishPress Taxonomies Pro，您可以复制分类术语及其所有元数据。这包括术语描述、图像和自定义字段。您可以在分类之间复制术语，以在您的网站上保持一致的组织。','Choose the display formats of your terms, options include table list, ordered list, border-cloud and lots more.'=>'选择您的术语的显示格式，选项包括表格列表、有序列表、边框云等。','Hourly'=>'每小时','Daily'=>'每日','Pro Feature'=>'专业功能','Some of these features are available in PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'这些功能中的一些在 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 中可用','ID'=>'ID','Name (Pro)'=>'名称 (专业)','Counter (Pro)'=>'计数器 (专业)','Random (Pro)'=>'随机 (专业)','Term Order (Pro)'=>'术语顺序 (专业)','Method for choosing terms for display'=>'选择显示术语的方法','Name'=>'名称','Counter'=>'计数器','Term Order'=>'术语顺序','Disabled'=>'已禁用','You have disabled PublishPress Taxonomies ordering'=>'您已禁用 PublishPress Taxonomies 的排序','Terms in this taxonomy are ordered by %s'=>'此分类法中的术语按 %s 排序','Term Order(Pro)'=>'术语顺序 (专业)','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro to use Term Order to manually order Terms'=>'升级到 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 以使用术语顺序手动排序术语','Request completed.'=>'请求已完成。','Security error. Kindly reload this page and try again'=>'安全错误。请重新加载此页面并重试','Permission error. You do not have permission to manage PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'权限错误。您没有权限管理 PublishPress Taxonomies','Posts content and title is empty.'=>'帖子内容和标题为空。','Permission error. You do not have permission to preview this post.'=>'权限错误。您没有权限预览此帖子。','You do not have permission to manage this taxonomy. Enable Metabox Access Taxonomies for this role in %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.'=>'您没有权限管理此 taxonomy。在 %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s 中为此角色启用 Metabox Access Taxonomies。','Too many AI preview requests. Please wait a minute and try again.'=>'请求的 AI 预览次数过多。请稍等一会儿再试。','Term Results'=>'术语结果','No results found for this post with this taxonomy.'=>'未找到与此 taxonomy 关联的该帖子的结果。','Invalid Auto Term ID. Please save the settings before using preview.'=>'无效的自动术语 ID。请在使用预览之前保存设置。','You must enable at least one AI integration source to use auto term preview.'=>'您必须启用至少一个 AI 集成源才能使用自动术语预览。','This Auto Terms option is not enabled for metaboxes. Please enable it in the Auto Terms settings.'=>'此自动术语选项未为 metaboxes 启用。请在自动术语设置中启用它。','Click %1s to select or deselect them from this %2s.'=>'点击 %1s 从该 %2s 中选择或取消选择它们。','Suggest Existing Terms'=>'建议现有术语','OpenAI'=>'OpenAI','IBM Watson'=>'IBM Watson','Dandelion'=>'蒲公英','LSEG / Refinitiv'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv','Update %1s on this %2s'=>'在此 %2s 上更新 %1s','Existing Terms not found for the selected post type and taxonomies'=>'未找到与所选帖子类型和 taxonomies 相关的现有术语','Existing Terms taxonomy is required. Kindly select taxonomies and save the settings before running preview.'=>'需要现有术语 taxonomy。请在运行预览之前选择 taxonomies 并保存设置。','Result from ajax request.'=>'来自 ajax 请求的结果。','The selected taxonomy is not associated with the selected post type.'=>'所选的 taxonomy 与所选的 post type 不相关联。','No results found for this taxonomy.'=>'未找到该 taxonomy 的结果。','You do not have permission to edit this post.'=>'您没有权限编辑此帖子。','You do not have permission to assign terms from this taxonomy.'=>'您没有权限从此 taxonomy 分配术语。','Click Term to select or deselect from this %1s'=>'单击术语以从此 %1s 中选择或取消选择','Both Taxonomy and Post are required.'=>'taxonomy 和 post 都是必需的。','No new terms were selected or deselected.'=>'没有选择或取消选择新术语。','%1s terms added to this %2s.'=>'%1s 术语已添加到此 %2s。','%1s terms removed from this %2s.'=>'%1s 术语已从此 %2s 中移除。','You do not have capability to manage this taxonomy.'=>'您没有管理此 taxonomy 的能力。','You do not have permission to edit this post with this taxonomy.'=>'您没有权限使用此 taxonomy 编辑此帖子。','Terms cannot contain the following characters: %s'=>'术语不能包含以下字符：%s','Terms must be at least %d characters long.'=>'术语必须至少 %d 个字符长。','Terms cannot exceed %d characters.'=>'术语不能超过 %d 个字符。','The Dandelion integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'Dandelion 集成在 Legacy AI Sources 设置中已禁用。','No matched result from the API Server.'=>'API 服务器没有匹配的结果。','The Dandelion integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'Dandelion 集成需要一个 API 密钥。请在自动术语设置中添加您的 API 密钥。','Selected content is empty.'=>'所选内容为空。','Result from cache.'=>'来自缓存的结果。','API Error: %1s.'=>'API 错误：%1$s。','Result from api.'=>'来自 API 的结果。','Error establishing connection with the API server. Try again.'=>'与 API 服务器建立连接时出错。请重试。','The LSEG / Refinitiv integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv 集成在遗留 AI 源设置中已禁用。','The LSEG / Refinitiv integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv 集成需要 API 密钥。请在自动术语设置中添加您的 API 密钥。','API Error: No matched result for content.'=>'API 错误：没有匹配的内容结果。','The IBM Watson integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'IBM Watson 集成在遗留 AI 源设置中已禁用。','The IBM Watson integration requires an API Key and URL. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'IBM Watson 集成需要 API 密钥和 URL。请在自动术语设置中添加您的 API 密钥。','The IBM Watson API URL must use HTTPS and an official Natural Language Understanding service hostname.'=>'IBM Watson API URL 必须使用 HTTPS 和官方自然语言理解服务主机名。','The OpenAI integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'OpenAI 集成需要 API 密钥。请在自动术语设置中添加您的 API 密钥。','Invalid placeholder(s) detected: {%s}. Valid placeholders are: {content}, {post_terms}, {site_terms}'=>'检测到无效的占位符：{%s}。有效的占位符有：{content}，{post_terms}，{site_terms}','You added {post_terms} in the prompt but your post does not contain any terms.'=>'您在提示中添加了 {post_terms}，但您的帖子不包含任何术语。','You added {site_terms} in the prompt but your site does not contain any terms for this taxonomy.'=>'您在提示中添加了 {site_terms}，但您的站点不包含此分类法的任何术语。','Error: OpenAI says there is an issue with this API key. Please check your plan or billing details.'=>'错误：OpenAI 表示此 API 密钥存在问题。请检查您的计划或账单详细信息。','Show All Existing Terms'=>'显示所有现有术语','Manage Post Terms'=>'管理帖子术语','Auto Terms'=>'自动术语','Create Terms'=>'创建术语','View Existing Terms'=>'查看现有术语','This feature allows you to browse all the terms in a taxonomy.'=>'此功能允许您浏览分类法中的所有术语。','View Current Post Terms'=>'查看当前帖子术语','This feature allows you to manage all the terms that are currently attached to a post.'=>'此功能允许您管理当前附加到帖子的所有术语。','View Terms'=>'查看术语','This feature allows you to browse based on selected auto terms settings and sources.'=>'此功能允许您根据所选的自动术语设置和来源进行浏览。','Suggest Terms'=>'建议术语','Select all %1s'=>'选择所有 %1s','Deselect all %1s'=>'取消选择所有 %1s','Select %1s'=>'选择 %1s','Please choose a post to use with PublishPress Taxonomies AI.'=>'请选择一个帖子以与 PublishPress Taxonomies AI 一起使用。','Label can\'t be empty.'=>'标签不能为空。','Label can\'t exceed 30 characters.'=>'标签不能超过 30 个字符。','Unknown tab type.'=>'未知的选项卡类型。','Error saving label.'=>'保存标签时出错。','Please choose a post to preview.'=>'请选择一个帖子进行预览。','Metaboxes'=>'元框','Metabox Settings'=>'元框设置','Metabox Access'=>'元框访问','This feature allows you to customize the metabox interface you see when adding terms to posts.'=>'此功能允许您自定义在将术语添加到帖子时看到的元框界面。','Save Changes'=>'保存更改','Select...'=>'选择...','Select %s'=>'选择 %s','Invalid request.'=>'无效请求。','No terms in your WordPress database.'=>'您的 WordPress 数据库中没有术语。','There\'s no content to scan.'=>'没有内容可供扫描。','No results from your WordPress database.'=>'您的 WordPress 数据库没有结果。','There are no terms that are relevant to your content.'=>'没有与您的内容相关的术语。','Tags'=>'标签','PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies','This user does not have access to manage any of this post attached taxonomies. Enable Metabox Access Taxonomies for this role in %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.'=>'该用户没有权限管理此帖子附加的任何分类。请在 %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s 中为该角色启用 Metabox 访问分类。','No PublishPress Taxonomies Metabox features are enabled for this post type.'=>'此帖子类型未启用任何 PublishPress Taxonomies Metabox 功能。','Save, You can also press Enter to save and escape to cancel'=>'保存，您也可以按 Enter 键保存，按 Esc 键取消','Search Terms...'=>'搜索术语...','Create Term'=>'创建术语','You do not have the required capabilities to manage any of this post attached taxonomies.'=>'您没有管理此帖子附加的任何分类所需的能力。','You can not edit this label.'=>'您无法编辑此标签。','Invalid nonce token.'=>'无效的 nonce 令牌。','Label is too long.'=>'标签太长。','Hey, you\'ve been using PublishPress Taxonomies for %s on your site. We hope the plugin has been useful. Please could you quickly leave a 5-star rating on WordPress.org? It really does help to keep PublishPress Taxonomies growing.'=>'嘿，您在网站上使用 PublishPress Taxonomies 已经 %s 了。我们希望这个插件对您有所帮助。请您快速在 WordPress.org 上留下 5 星评价吗？这确实有助于 PublishPress Taxonomies 的发展。','1 week'=>'1 周','3 months'=>'3 个月','Click here to add your rating for PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'点击这里添加您对 PublishPress Taxonomies 的评分','Maybe later'=>'也许稍后','I already did'=>'我已经评分了','This plugin can be deleted.'=>'此插件可以被删除。','PublishPress Taxonomies was not activated because PublishPress Taxonomies Pro is already active. Please keep only PublishPress Taxonomies Pro enabled.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies 未被激活，因为 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 已经激活。请仅保留 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 启用。','PublishPress Taxonomies: Options'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies：选项','term nameName'=>'名称','term nameTaxonomy'=>'taxonomy']];